# Real personal photos and derived artifacts -- deliberately never published.
# dataset/sharp/ holds real photos (family, wedding guests, a child) contributed
# for local model training; none of those people consented to public posting.
# manifest.json records their original folder paths/names, so it's excluded too.
dataset/sharp/
dataset/blurry/
dataset/manifest.json

# Trained checkpoint: a binary build artifact derived from the private photos above,
# and easy to regenerate locally via train_on_real_photos.py / train_on_dataset.py.
outputs/checkpoint.pt

# Qualitative panel rendered from real personal photos (crops of the dataset above).
# training_curves_real.png is kept -- it's just a loss/PSNR chart, no photo content.
outputs/validation_qualitative_real.png

# Claude Code project state (not relevant to other users/contributors)
.claude/
